title: R1_D2_Task_Manni
tags: #run_1 #day_2 #scene #loc_Breakroom
---
<<bg bg_breakroom>>
Location: Break room. Cheap coffee machine, humming fridge, window that technically counts as natural light.
Manni: There they are. New handle. Come on in, the coffee's terrible.
He pours something questionably coffee, slides it over, flips his phone to show his leaderboard crown and obscene Store balance.
Manni: They give us this stupid "mentor" function. Makes them feel like they're fostering community. I can gift some credits. Helps you catch up. Makes me look generous on an HR slide.
HUD pings: Incoming transfer from Manni.
Manni: So. You in?
-> Accept the credits.
    <<jump R1_D2_Payoff_Manni_Accept>>
-> Refuse the credits.
    <<jump R1_D2_Payoff_Manni_Refuse>>

===

title: R1_D2_Payoff_Manni_Accept
tags: #run_1 #day_2 #scene
---
<<bg bg_breakroom>>
You accept; HUD flashes, balance ticking upward.
Manni grins: "Consider it an investment. You do well, I say I mentored you."
<<set $rapid_feedback_cash += 5>>
<<set $manni_friendliness += 1>>
<<set $d2_task_manni = true>>
<<set $d2_slots_used += 1>>
<<jump R1_D2_Dayplanner>>

===

title: R1_D2_Payoff_Manni_Refuse
